#EXTM3U
# cz-tv built-in lineup.
#
# This is the list every fresh install starts with. It is a plain M3U file: to
# add a channel, add two lines. Nothing here is compiled in as source code, and
# a channel pull request touches only this file.
#
# The rules every line here has to meet are in CONTRIBUTING.md. In short: the
# publisher's own free feed, https, no account, no credential in the URL,
# nothing rebroadcast from a pay service, H.264 + AAC over HLS, and a frame
# decoded and LOOKED AT (tools/check-channels.sh does this and builds a
# contact sheet).
#
# Verified 2026-11-21.
